Note on upstream code
---------------------

This repository is a fork of MambaLiteUNet
(https://github.com/maklachur/MambaLiteUNet; Rahman, Jung, and Hammond,
CVPR 2026). As of the fork, that upstream repository publishes no LICENSE
file, and its GitHub license metadata is empty. The license of the inherited
MambaLiteUNet sources is therefore unclear. Nothing in this file claims that
the upstream authors released their code under MIT.

This MIT license is granted by the QAM-Seg fork contributors for the rights
they hold: the QAM-Seg additions (documentation, the parameter/FLOP script,
HD95 helpers, and SSL scaffolding). It does not relicense unmodified upstream
files. If the upstream authors publish a license, that license governs the
inherited files. Until then, treat unmodified upstream files as all rights
reserved by their authors.

See THIRD_PARTY.md.
